# Every file in this project is LF, and mixed endings here have caused real
# damage before (a tool silently rewrote merged_migrations.sql to CRLF).
# Git for Windows defaults to converting to CRLF on checkout, which would
# rewrite all ~170 files and bury every real change in whitespace noise.
# Pinning LF keeps the working copy matching what's committed on any machine.
* text=auto eol=lf
